30,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bay has a weight limit... and evening events might damage things that aren't enclosed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,It seems visitors prefer dynamic displays and the presence of people over static cases.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lab is totally overwhelmed! And most of our volunteers are just town history buffs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Kenji,,We've had delays with distant lenders and powered displays keep breaking down during the show.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Fascinating. Transport and bespoke mounts are quietly draining our budget. We should favor exhibits with their own supports.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, if we have heavy things or open displays, it might be a problem for the floor and the hire events.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, if the lab is backed up, we cannot afford a project that requires heavy conservation work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Exactly! We need something the volunteers can handle, like the history circle people.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, if people like ""dynamic"" things, maybe we should be careful about powered displays since they break so much.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A very logical point, Kenji. We need a balance between visitor appeal and operational stability.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm worried about anything too heavy... or too fragile for the evening bookings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Then we should look for something that involves people working in the gallery, as the comments suggest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Rin,,Yes! Someone talking or working makes people come back!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Kenji,,But let's avoid too many distant loans. The paperwork is a nightmare and causes delays.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are leaning toward a local, human-centric exhibition with minimal external shipping.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
